# Allowlist: ignore everything, then allow only known source files.
# A new file stays out of git until it is added here on purpose, so local
# secrets (.env, keys), chat.db, .venv and caches can never slip in.
*

# Folders must be re-allowed so git can look inside them.
!*/

# Project files.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!*.py
!docs/*.md

# Never commit these, even if a rule above would match.
.venv/
__pycache__/
.env*
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite*
*.pem
*.key
